  "description": "Radically overhauled, the Nemo Gravel represents our most intensely hybridized and extreme adventure gravel bike ever, entirely handcrafted by Cinelli’s internal framebuilder in its Milanese HQ using custom drawn triple butted tube drawn by its sister company Columbus, less than 100 metres from the framebuilding workshop. Continuously refined over a one year period of testing by riders including former UCI World Champions, NYC courier legends, professional snowboarders and many other athletes pushing to redefine the limits of what gravel cycling can be, the Nemo Gravel is characterized above all by its completely redesigned geometry, 700 x 47mm tyre clearance and the use of the Hi-Ride Sterra fork with 20mm of true hydraulic travel. Together these features work to create a bike that is ready to tackle the world’s most extreme gravel competitions and adventures.",
